    "pattern": "Platform 6 systems: Modular Monolith domain services (SYS-BCERP-WEB) + Platform Core identity/audit/analytics (SYS-CORE-BACKEND) + Headless Integration Gateway (SYS-INTEGRATION-GW) + Thin Clients (PORTAL-WEB DMZ, MOBILE-INTERNAL, MOBILE-PORTAL) — 60 components",
